      "message": "test(ui): scope the stock page Delete lookup to the Properties pane\n\nThe ribbon Delete button got an AccessKit node in #2081. The label\n\"Delete\" now matches two nodes, so get_by_label failed. The test now\nselects the Delete node inside the Properties pane and asserts that\nexactly one exists.\n\nFixes #2170\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
